  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Auto_Picker_Filter/MP_AutoPickerFilter_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"900\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">是否厭倦了在探索、種田或戰鬥時，不斷撿起重複、煩人或無用的物品？自動拾取過濾器（Auto Pickup Filter）讓你能夠阻止自動收集任何物品，無論是原版 Minecraft 還是模組添加的物品。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/I2fb3ygoq4k\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Auto_Picker_Filter/MP_AutoPickerFilter_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">🛠️ 使用方法</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">自動拾取過濾器非常容易使用，無需開啟選單或進行複雜的設定。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">1 - 打開你的背包<strong>或</strong>在 <strong>JEI / REI</strong> 中搜尋物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">2 - 將游標懸停在<strong>不希望被自動拾取</strong>的物品上。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">3 - 按下<strong><code>I</code></strong> 鍵。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">4 - 從此刻起，<strong>該物品將不再從地面上自動拾取</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">若要恢復自動拾取，只需在同一物品上再次<strong>按下 <code>I</code> 鍵</strong>即可。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">⭐ 功能特色</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">透過單一按鍵即可啟用或停用<strong>物品自動拾取</strong>功能。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">支援<strong>所有物品</strong>（包含原版與模組物品）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">使用<strong><code>I</code></strong> 鍵快速切換。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">與 <strong>JEI &amp; REI 完全相容</strong>，包含物品列表與搜尋結果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">非常適合過濾重複或無用的物品（種子、腐肉、羽毛……）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">大幅改善<strong>背包管理</strong>與整體遊戲體驗。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">⚙️ 需求</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">Architectury API（必要）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Auto_Picker_Filter/MP_AutoPickerFilter_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"350\"></strong></a>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>今天就擁有你自己的 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">，與朋友享受無限冒險！我們提供頂級效能與穩定運行時間，確保每位玩家都能擁有流暢有趣的遊戲體驗。輸入優惠碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a> 即可享有 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">25% 折扣！</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Auto_Picker_Filter/MP_AutoPickerFilter_discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
